  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The equivalent current due to the motion of the electron is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>e</mi><mi>&#965;</mi></math></p><p>So, the magnetic moment will be</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>&#965;</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p>",
